    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίμφ-ᾰ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lightly, swiftly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίμφα ἑ γοῦνα φέρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.511
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				342
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὶ δὲ πέτοντο ῥ. μάλ</span>'
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. μάλα τρωχῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.163
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον ἕλοντο . . ῥ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				8.54
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. τοξεύειν ὕμνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέβακεν ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				407
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.387
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1194
			</span></i>.</div>
